{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have strong evidence for the core chain. Let me verify the key remaining link: that Jokha Alharthi was born in Akure (the city where Obioma grew up). The puzzle says the prize-winning author was born in the same city where the first book's author grew up. Obioma was born in Akure (e1). I need to confirm Alharthi was born in Akure — but that seems unlikely for an Omani author. Let me reconsider.\n\nActually, re-reading the puzzle: \"The author of this prize-winning book was born in the same city where the author of the initially mentioned book grew up.\" This means Alharthi was born in the city where Obioma grew up. But Obioma grew up in Akure (Nigeria), and Alharthi is Omani. This doesn't fit.\n\nLet me reconsider — perhaps the first book is \"The Fishermen (2015)\" and the 2016 International Booker winner (The Vegetarian by Han Kang, published 2015) is the connection. Han Kang was born in Gwangju. Did Obioma grow up in Gwangju? No.\n\nLet me reconsider whether the award might be different, or whether I have the wrong first book. Let me check the Jokha Alharthi Wikipedia page to see where she was born.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Jokha Alharthi Wikipedia born\", \"Jokha Alharthi born city Oman biography\", \"Jokha Alharthi Celestial Bodies author birthplace\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_0aa62b12ac0b4d4192af173a","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789475163,"id":"chatcmpl-08919fff-20e0-9f2b-9a40-7142f125c86d","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":20685,"completion_tokens":337,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":21022,"cached_tokens":1024,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1024},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}